# Editor and rollback copies. This repo is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages needs public on
# the free plan) and everything in it is served: index.html.bak-2026-09-14 was
# reachable at
#   https://ghostizshah.github.io/pixelfolk-privacy/index.html.bak-2026-09-14
# and still carried the personal contact address that 8e19994 had just replaced
# with the dedicated pixelfolk.games one. Swapping the address in index.html
# achieved little while the old copy sat one URL away.
#
# Same rule as requiem-hub's .gitignore, for the same reason: a rollback copy in
# a public repo is published, not archived. Keep backups outside the repo.
*.bak
*.bak-*
